   "text": "In this town, a mysterious train arrives every night at 3:33 AM.",
   "speak": "In this town, a mysterious train arrives every night at three thirty-three A.M.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]"
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody knows where it comes from.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]"
  },
  {
   "text": "And nobody is allowed to board it.",
   "tag": "[ominous]",
   "pause": 0.45
  },
  {
   "text": "But one night, a girl named Grace missed the last bus home.",
   "tag": "[curious]"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then she heard a train approaching.",
   "tag": "[tense]",
   "pause": 0.35
  },
  {
   "text": "The station clock read 3:33.",
   "speak": "The station clock read three thirty-three.",
   "tag": "[whispers]",
   "pause": 0.4
  },
  {
   "text": "A beautiful silver train stopped in front of her.",
   "tag": "[in awe]"
  },
  {
   "text": "Its doors opened.",
   "tag": "[quietly]",
   "pause": 0.35
  },
  {
   "text": "Inside, every passenger was asleep.",
   "tag": "[uneasy]"
  },
  {
   "text": "Grace stepped aboard.",
   "tag": "[tense]",
   "pause": 0.4
  },
  {
   "text": "The train began moving.",
   "tag": "[tense]"
  },
  {
   "text": "But when she looked outside, the town had disappeared.",
   "tag": "[uneasy]"
  },
  {
   "text": "Instead, the train was traveling through the stars.",
   "tag": "[in awe]",
   "pause": 0.45
  },
  {
   "text": "Suddenly, the passengers opened their eyes.",
   "tag": "[fearful]"
  },
  {
   "text": "Every single one looked exactly like Grace.",
   "tag": "[fearful]",
   "pause": 0.4
  },
  {
   "text": "An announcement echoed through the carriage.",
   "tag": "[tense]",
   "pause": 0.3
  },
  {
   "text": "“FINAL STOP. THE LIFE YOU DIDN'T CHOOSE.”",
